    "message": "Pair GBS speed claims with quantitative accuracy and real Jiuzhang data\n\nImplement native factorized IPF with 191.44-fold smaller core representation at 128 inputs / 384 outputs. Enumerate same-input click laws and audit real-data fixed marginals with explicit physical-model sensitivity.\n\nPreserve Frugal wins, direct numerical failures and incomplete archives. Full hardware throughput and full-distribution superiority remain unproved.\n\nValidation: 2594 independent checks; 952 tests run, 923 passed, zero failures/errors; twelve new tests.",
